# Windows7Enhanced color scheme
# Part of the "Windows 7 Enhanced" theme pack (GPL-3.0-or-later).
#
# A self-contained Windows 7 Aero-inspired palette. If you prefer the exact
# palette of the original setup (ExposeAir by Mark Whittaker, GPL-2.0+),
# install that scheme and set ColorScheme=ExposeAir in the look-and-feel
# defaults instead.

